Root cause:
The bug was caused by the use of a combined keymap that included both button and switch entries, which could lead to userspace being incorrectly informed about the availability of switches when none existed. The patch splits the keymap into separate button and switch parts, allowing for better management of the inputs and preventing erroneous communication to userspace regarding the state of the devices.
